title: Add the parachain speculative messaging pallet
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Parachain runtimes can use the new pallet to manage channels, consume messages and publish acknowledgements. To enable it, configure the pallet as the parachain system's ConsumptionRecordSource and implement SpecMsgApi for collators.
crates:
- name: cumulus-pallet-spec-messaging
  bump: minor
- name: cumulus-primitives-core
  bump: minor
- name: cumulus-pallet-parachain-system
  bump: none
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: none
- name: frame-benchmarking-cli
  bump: none
